ed of a solid blunt head attached to a haft.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p>\n<ul><li><span style=\"background-color: initial; color: #FF0000;\"><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: inherit;\"><i>This item cannot be fed to <a href=\"/page/Sentient_Weapon\" title=\"Sentient Weapon\">sentient jewels</a>.</i></span></span></li>\n<li>This is a legacy weapon from a now-obsolete crafting system, and is no longer available via the tutorial.</li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817043731\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.078 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.119 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3911/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 24460/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5213/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 32/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 13/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  101.596      1 -total\n 95.17%   96.684      1 Template:Named_item\n 92.64%   94.115      1 Template:Named_Weapon\n 74.96%   76.159     41 Template:IO\n 27.57%   28.009      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 26.90%   27.326      1 Template:IsLamannia\n 24.82%   25.218      1 Template:IsSpeculation\n 22.37%   22.729      1 Template:InCategory\n 21.32%   21.662      1 Template:Non-food\n 19.62%   19.938      4 Template:Popup\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:17566-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817043731 and revision id 630838. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"
